@startuml Sequence_API_Key
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}

title Sequence Diagram: Quan ly AI API Key (BKDNOJ moi)

actor "User" as U
participant "Django Site" as Site
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "AI Provider" as AI

== 1. Xem danh sach API keys ==
U -> Site : GET /accounts/api-keys/
Site -> DB : SELECT AIAPIKey\nWHERE user=current_user
Site --> U : Trang quan ly API keys\n(hien thi: provider, last4,\nstatus, default_model)

== 2. Them API key moi ==
U -> Site : POST /accounts/api-keys/add/\n{provider, api_key_plaintext,\ndefault_model}

Site -> Site : Ma hoa API key:\n1. SHA-256('aiapikey-encryption-'\n   + SECRET_KEY)\n2. Base64URL encode\n3. Fernet(key).encrypt(plaintext)
Site -> Site : Lay 4 ky tu cuoi\nlam key_last4

Site -> DB : INSERT AIAPIKey\n{user, provider,\nkey_ciphertext,\nkey_last4,\nstatus='pending',\ndefault_model}

Site --> U : JSON {success, key_id}

== 3. Test ket noi API key ==
U -> Site : POST /accounts/api-keys/<id>/test/

Site -> DB : SELECT AIAPIKey WHERE id=<id>
Site -> Site : Giai ma API key\nbang Fernet

Site -> DB : SELECT AIPromptTemplate\nWHERE key='api_key_test'
note right of Site : Prompt: "Reply exactly: OK"

Site -> AI : HTTPS POST\n{model: default_model,\nmessage: test prompt}\ntimeout=30s

alt Test thanh cong
  AI --> Site : Response: "OK"
  Site -> DB : UPDATE AIAPIKey\nstatus='verified'
  Site -> DB : INSERT AIAPIKeyTestLog\n{success=True,\nresponse_time_ms}
  Site --> U : JSON {status: 'success',\nresponse_time_ms}
else Test that bai
  AI --> Site : Error / Timeout
  Site -> DB : UPDATE AIAPIKey\nstatus='failed',\nstatus_detail=error
  Site -> DB : INSERT AIAPIKeyTestLog\n{success=False,\ndetail=error}
  Site --> U : JSON {status: 'error',\ndetail}
end

Site -> Site : Xoa plaintext\nkhoi memory

== 4. Xem log test ==
U -> Site : GET /accounts/api-keys/<id>/logs/
Site -> DB : SELECT AIAPIKeyTestLog\nWHERE api_key=<id>\nORDER BY tested_at DESC
Site --> U : JSON [{tested_at, provider,\nmodel, success, detail,\nresponse_time_ms}, ...]

== 5. Xoa API key ==
U -> Site : POST /accounts/api-keys/<id>/delete/
Site -> DB : DELETE AIAPIKey WHERE id=<id>
note right of DB : Cascade delete\nAIAPIKeyTestLog
Site --> U : JSON {success}

@enduml
